{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 4期生　岩手県出身"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤璃果です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ6FFN8AC33GYXXN3Z1K9D0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#sayakacamera"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は全国イベント参加券限定オンライン ミート&グリート来て下さった皆さん、ありがとうございました( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかけに沢山撮って貰ったことが嬉しくてブログを更新してしまいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮りあいっこ楽しかったです〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ6FGMW05ZMD07F99HN9GXD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 耳かけ巻き下ろし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、3月4日は、｢のぎおび｣の担当でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎおび選手権も優勝しそうだったのに...11個質問に答えてしまった。残念でした...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ6FHKVAVHDGPWG2BEXPS56","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは最近｢乃木坂工事中｣にも出演してました〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4期生ダービー本当に悔しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなに先輩が私の名前を書いてくれたのに1回も1位になれず、申し訳ないです、、松村さんはハートを書いてくださったし堀さんは可愛らしい似顔絵も書いてくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんがボードに名前を書いてくださるだけでこんなに嬉しい気持ちになるなんて...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな時でもこれからも精一杯頑張ります〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自身、静電気を常に発している人間なので、ビリビリペンに強かったのかもしれません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ6FJPTRHFEPSTPK1G44N8G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n2部 羊ちゃん＠・ｴ・＠"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部はツインテール 4部はポニーテールでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影者おかけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうお掛け"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜〜〜質問〜〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇そういや璃果ちゃんは誕プレで何か印象に残ってるものとかあるの？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバムを作ってくれたり、誕生日当日に荷物が届くようにしてくれたり、地元の学校でみんなでお祝いしてくれたり、お手紙を下さったり、沢山ありがとうございましたの気持ちです。これからもよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇花粉って東京より岩手の方が飛んでる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じかなぁ...。くしゃみした後に一人でいる時にあえいうおーって言ってしまうのが悩みです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇最近食べたいと思ってるものはある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生クリーム、激辛インドカレー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇丸一日休暇をもらえたら何をする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旅をしたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇振り入れで1番苦戦した曲はありますか〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスが難しかったのは、｢Sing Out!｣ ｢僕は僕を好きになる｣歌割りが難しかったのは｢何度目の青空か｣移動が難しかったのは｢インフルエンサー｣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部思い出深いです(ᯅ̈ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇璃果ちゃんとかっきーが最近話したエピソード聞きたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの時にかっきー達が次に早着替えの曲で、邪魔にならないように退けなきゃ！と思ったら勢い余って私が機材にぶつかってしまったことを終わったあとに話しかけてくれて心配してくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ◜︎◡︎◝︎ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇呪術廻戦ってアニメで見てる？漫画で見てる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメ！！漫画で見た方がいいのかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇璃果ちゃんが1番成績良かった教科は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数学と倫理かな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。でも数学系科目が増えて5教科ぐらいになった時に頭が爆発してしまいました。( ◜︎◡︎◝︎ ) "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇きのこの山かたけのこの里どっち派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たけのこの里"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近食べてないなぁ(   ˙༥˙   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇璃果ちゃんの好きな季節は〜？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏から秋になる間かなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん質問してくれてありがとう^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと答えたいなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、「ヤンマガWeb」さんの企画『坂道ネクストジェネレーション＋』さんに私のグラビアが公開されましたので、是非チェックしてみてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショットまた載せます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グラビアで滅多に無い衣装を着ました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは皆さんにとって素敵な一日になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ6FKPXP3E79GNQVH6X5RS0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nまたね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#67 りか"}],"source":"archive"}